			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): implement Mountain-side IPC layer for sidecar processes\n\n- Introduces Vine IPC system for Mountain<->Cocoon communication using stdio pipes\n- Defines VineMessage structure with Request/Response/Notification types and JSON serialization\n- Implements async reader/writer tasks for handling message framing via newline-delimited JSON\n- Manages pending requests with timeout handling and automatic cleanup during sidecar shutdown\n- Routes incoming sidecar requests to Track dispatcher via `track::dispatch_sidecar_request`\n- Handles special notifications like 'extHostReadyForInit' by emitting Tauri events\n- Integrates with AppState and AppRuntime for request processing context\n- Provides error handling with detailed VineError types and logging\n- Supports bidirectional communication required for Cocoon extension host integration\n- Implements process monitoring and channel cleanup when sidecars exit\n\nThis foundational component enables Mountain to communicate with Node.js sidecar processes like Cocoon, critical for running VS Code extensions while maintaining Tauri's performance advantages. Establishes core IPC infrastructure for Path A MVP where extensions run in separate processes.",
			"SHA": "d2e0bdcad933cc8330d3c6dd7e0f8d353ac51e49"
