			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement core runtime for effect execution\n\n- Introduces `AppRuntime` struct wrapping `DefaultRuntime` from `Land_Common`\n- Integrates `MountainEnvironment` to provide concrete effect implementations\n- Enables execution of `ActionEffect` instances through async `run` method\n- Serves as central effect processor for command/sidecar request dispatchers\n- Managed by Tauri via dependency injection (`State<'_, Arc<AppRuntime>>`)\n\nThis foundational component allows Mountain to execute environment-specific operations while maintaining separation between generic runtime logic (in Common) and Mountain's concrete implementations. The design supports future extension of effect types and ensures proper async execution context management through Tauri's state system.",
