			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement core environment with provider traits\n\n- Introduces `MountainEnvironment` as concrete implementation of VS Code-equivalent environment interfaces\n- Implements critical provider traits: `FsReader`, `FsWriter`, `StorageProvider`, `ConfigProvider`, `DocumentProvider`, and 10+ others\n- Integrates with `AppState` for configuration management, document tracking, and extension storage\n- Implements security checks via `is_path_allowed` using workspace/app data boundaries\n- Bridges Tauri APIs with extension requirements through handler modules (`handlers::config`, `handlers::documents`)\n- Establishes base for extension-host communication via `IpcProvider` Vine integration\n- Includes stubbed UI interactions with event flow design for future Sky frontend integration\n\nEnables MVP extension capabilities including filesystem access, configuration management, and document operations while maintaining Electron migration performance goals.",
