			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				147,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(license): improve formatting and readability of license document\n\n- Reformatted sections 2.1-2.3, 5, 6.2-6.4, 10, 11 and Appendix A using consistent indentation and bullet points\n- Added line breaks to improve scannability of complex legal clauses\n- Restructured nested list items to clarify patent grant exclusions (2.2) and acceptance conditions (10)\n- Maintained all original legal terms while enhancing document structure\n- Improved separation between license clauses and commentary/notes\n\nThese changes enhance the maintainability of the LPL-1.0 license document while preserving its legal intent, ensuring contributors and downstream users can more easily understand Land's licensing terms. The formatting improvements support Land's open source compliance strategy as the project prepares for wider adoption.",
			"SHA": "f4749992d1447a0dc947e03ce9bb5d4c03bf56c9"
