			"Message": "docs(LICENSE): Reformat termination clauses for improved readability\n\n- Restructured Article 12 into bullet points with proper indentation to enhance readability of license termination provisions\n- Maintained identical legal content while improving document maintainability\n- Aligns with Land's focus on clear documentation for contributors and downstream users\n- No changes to actual license terms or substantive content - purely formatting improvements",
