				147,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(license): adopt Land Public Licence v1.0\n\n- Replaces CC0 1.0 Universal with custom Land Public Licence (LPL v1.0) to establish copyleft requirements\n- Introduces strong reciprocal licensing for modifications while allowing combination with External Works under separate licenses\n- Adds explicit patent grants with defensive termination clauses to protect project contributors\n- Specifies Bulgarian jurisdiction and dispute resolution processes aligned with Land's stewardship\n- Requires preservation of LPL terms in distributed works while clarifying separation from External Work licenses\n- Establishes compatibility mechanisms with GPLv3+/AGPLv3+/EUPL/MPL2.0 through Appendix A (pending validation)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All contributions now fall under LPL's copyleft terms rather than public domain dedication. Existing contributors must accept new license terms.",
			"SHA": "1fc973dee244efe36f4cf298f3744d7d52582aba"
