			"Message": "build(Sky): Add --force flag to Sky build commands\n\n- Forces clean rebuild of @codeeditorland/sky frontend during development and production builds by adding `--force` to pnpm commands\n- Ensures cached artifacts from previous builds don't cause inconsistencies in Tauri environment\n- Addresses intermittent issues where Sky UI changes weren't properly reflected due to pnpm's package linking behavior\n- Aligns with Land's reliability goals by enforcing deterministic build outputs across environments\n- Maintains parity between dev and production build processes for the webview frontend",
