			"Message": "chore: Add manifest-src directive to CSP policies\n\nAdded 'manifest-src \"self\"' directive to both production and development Content Security Policies in Tauri configuration. This change ensures the application can properly load its manifest file from the same origin while maintaining security restrictions.\n\nThe update aligns CSP policies with Progressive Web App requirements and prevents potential browser restrictions regarding manifest loading. By including this directive in both environments, we maintain consistent security policies across development and production builds.",
